//! Oracle rows from Wine's `dlls/msadp32.acm/msadp32.c`, compiled verbatim under
//! ASan and UBSan behind a small harness, plus edge tests for the branches the
//! rows do not reach. The rows are generated by `canon/msadp32.acm/gen.py`.

